      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu ana kwetu, chinenjili kudenu nakushimuna nsaŋu yaNzambi, hinenjili namazu asweja kuwaha, hela akuyihayamisha namaanaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twahoshaŋa yama ana nawakula dehi; himaana amakonu, hela awanyanta amakonuku, wenawa keŋahiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twashimunaŋa maana aNzambi akujinda, ajindiluwu dehi, Nzambi wayitoŋwelaŋahu dehi henohu mpata jichidi kanda ajileŋi, kulonda kutulemesha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyanta ampata yinu hiyeluka wena maanawaku; neyi ayilukili, mutenowu hiyapopeleli Mwanta waMpuhu kukulusuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chanasonekuwu nawu, Nzambi waloŋeshela dehi antu amukeŋa yuma yabulili kumona mesu, yabulili kutiya matu, yabulili kwijila mumuchima wamuntu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa Nzambi natumwckesheliyi naSpiritu. Muloŋa Spiritu washinshikaŋa yuma yonsu, chalala yuma yaNzambi yayeni yakunama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntwinyi welukaŋa yitoŋojoka yamuntu, chiŋa spiritu yayomweni muntu? Chochina niyitoŋojoka yaNzambi, kwosi wayilukaku, chiŋa Spiritu yaNzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etu hitunatambuli spiritu yamunu mwishinaku, tunatambuli Spiritu wakudi Nzambi, kulonda twiluki yuma yanatwinkuwu kudi Nzambi chamukunkulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Diyi yuma yitwahoshaŋa, hitwahoshaŋa namazu atulejaŋa nama ana awantuku, chiŋa namazu atulejaŋawu kudi Spiritu, nakwesekeja yuma yawuspiritu nayuma yawuspiritu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwinza muntu wachisemwa hatambulaŋa yuma yaSpiritu yaNzambuku, muloŋa yena wukuyimona nindi wusupi; hakutwesha kuyilukaku, muŋa ayishinshikaŋa naSpiritu hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwila muntu waSpiritu wasompeshaŋa yuma yonsu, yena yomweni hiyamusompeshaŋa kudi muntuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinyi weluka mwatoŋojokaŋayi Yehova, mwaka amuleji maana? Ilaŋa etu tukweti yitoŋojoka yaKristu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
